/P 92 0 R
/T (Many teachers feel uncertain about how to use educational robotics beyond STEM disciplines. Yet, with creative planning and pedagogical flexibility, robotics can powerfully enhance teaching in arts, literature, languages, history, civic education, and cultural studies. This section provides practical guidance for integrating robots into arts and humanities lessons, along with realistic classroom examples that emphasize inquiry, creativity, and cross-disciplinary learning.)
/E (Many teachers feel uncertain about how to use educational robotics beyond STEM disciplines. Yet, with creative planning and pedagogical flexibility, robotics can powerfully enhance teaching in arts, literature, languages, history, civic education, and cultural studies. This section provides practical guidance for integrating robots into arts and humanities lessons, along with realistic classroom examples that emphasize inquiry, creativity, and cross-disciplinary learning.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [10]
