422 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 92 0 R
/T (Robotics can also support historical learning by helping students reconstruct key events and simulate the journeys of historical figures. Teachers might ask students to create a floor-based timeline where robots move along a path representing important events, such as the civil rights movement or ancient trade routes. As the robot arrives at each milestone, students can trigger recorded narrations or act out mini-presentations. This method makes abstract historical narratives concrete and spatial, improving recall and engagement)
/E (Robotics can also support historical learning by helping students reconstruct key events and simulate the journeys of historical figures. Teachers might ask students to create a floor-based timeline where robots move along a path representing important events, such as the civil rights movement or ancient trade routes. As the robot arrives at each milestone, students can trigger recorded narrations or act out mini-presentations. This method makes abstract historical narratives concrete and spatial, improving recall and engagement)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [14]
>>
endobj
