/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 93 0 R
/T (To ensure success, begin with small, manageable projects that align with existing curriculum goals. Co-designing activities with students helps build ownership and creativity. Teachers should feel free to adapt the complexity of coding and design tasks to match the age group and confidence level of learners. Integrating storytelling, visual design, sound, and movement allows students with different strengths and learning styles to contribute meaningfully.)
/E (To ensure success, begin with small, manageable projects that align with existing curriculum goals. Co-designing activities with students helps build ownership and creativity. Teachers should feel free to adapt the complexity of coding and design tasks to match the age group and confidence level of learners. Integrating storytelling, visual design, sound, and movement allows students with different strengths and learning styles to contribute meaningfully.)
